Package: atlasr
Title: Lazy Query Engine for Sparse Assay Atlases on R2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Atlas", "Team", email = "team@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: Lazy querying and analysis of extremely large sparse assay datasets stored
    as Parquet on Cloudflare R2 using DuckDB. Provides a pipeable DSL with margin
    context, lazy pruning, transformations, collapses, and safe collection into
    sparse matrices while preserving alignment invariants.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    digest,
    Matrix,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    magrittr,
    testthat
